<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson signs 2.6 bln SKR China deal.</title>
<headline>Ericsson signs 2.6 bln SKR China deal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group LM Ericsson AB on Tuesday said it had signed a 2.6 billion crown ($394 million) framework agreement with two Chinese business partners to supply digital mobile phone systems.</p>
<p>Ericsson said in a statement the deal had been signed with China National Posts and Telecommunications Industry Corp (PTIC) and The China National Posts and Telecommunications and Appliances Corp (PTAC).</p>
<p>($ = 6.599 Swedish Crowns)</p>
